  m_text: "\u2463 People\r\nAs many tasks (establishment, improvement, maintenance,
    etc.) are performed by employees and organizations specializing in software engineering,
    software engineering relatively depends more heavily on people.\r\nIt is practically
    impossible to summarize software development in an easily accessible or graspable
    manner because far more diverse issues arise than in other engineering situations.\r\n"
