  m_text: "\u2461 Tool\r\n\"Tool\" refers to an automated or semi-automated method
    that is used to improve productivity or consistency when performing a task.\r\nThere
    are numerous tools in the software development lifecycle (e.g. requirements management
    tools, modeling tools, configuration management tools, change management tools).\r\nWhen
    tools are integrated in such a way that the information created by one tool can
    be used by other tools, it is set as a system that supports software development.\r\n"
