  m_text: "\u2460 Method\r\nThe method is composed of project planning and estimation,
    system and software analysis, data structure, program structure, algorithm, coding,
    testing, and maintenance tasks.\r\nMethods centered on a specific language (e.g.
    an object-oriented method), or graphical notation, are introduced from time to
    time.\r\nA series of evaluation standards for software quality is introduced.\r\n"
